  "result": "The two decisions live in two files:\n\n- **Which organizations are due:** `shouldRunForOrg` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts`. On each scheduler tick, an organization is due only if it isn't archived and the current UTC hour equals its `settings.digestHourUtc`. The cron route (`src/app/api/cron/digest/route.ts`) only triggers the job; it doesn't make this decision.\n- **Who is on the list:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts`. It returns each distinct user in the organization who has at least one notification preference with `digestOnly = true`. `listDigestRecipients` in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` just passes that result through, so I left it out.\n\nANSWER: src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts, src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts",
